ildren on the autism spectrum through engaging, hands on learning activities.\nThe game includes multiple modes designed to improve motor skills, cognitive development, and learning through play:\nObject Grasping Exercises: Hand tracking based activities that help children practice fine motor skills by grabbing and interacting with virtual objects.\nMath Exercises: Simple and intuitive math challenges designed to reinforce basic numerical concepts in an stress-free environment.\nCycling & Animal Discovery Mode: A unique mode where children learn about animals while moving through the environment by cycling, combining physical activity with educational content.\nNote: The cycling mode requires additional hardware integration. Please contact us for more information regarding the cycling exercise setup.", "short_description": "VR4Autism is a VR game designed to support the education of children on the autism spectrum through interactive object grasping activities, basic math exercises, and an animal learning mode powered by cycling interaction."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrautism/ana-sayfa", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRCukurova", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://yuemco.github.io/VRApp2/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25806834358929346"}}]}, 